	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mulier haec cupivit se tibi commendari per dominum <persName>Marcum</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me; quod etsi nihil erat necesse, cum se dicat esse tibi notam, viro <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad omnia charitatis officia promptissimo, tamen eatenus eam tibi commendam<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>us, ut, quantum per graviores occupationes tuas liceat, autoritate <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tua iuves in negocio, quod coram explicabit; ea enim pietate utrumque <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nostrum iam ante devinctissimum amplius etiam demerebere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>omnibus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> 2a maii anno 1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Accepi hodie duces militum a principibus confoederatis con[scriptorum] <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>iterum dimissos esse, quod et ipsum argumento est a graviore [bello] <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>immunem vel hac aestate <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> fore.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Interea <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName> mile<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>s conscribitur a Caesare in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>, arbitror deducendus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>In provincia <placeName ref="l1805">Narbonensi</placeName> feruntur circiter 1000 familiae em<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>igrationem parare spontaneo exilio augescentem in dies persecutionem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>declinaturae.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2336">Bernardinum Ochinum</persName> ad <placeName ref="l648">Rhetos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>concessurum non sine voluptate accepi, quod sperem optimi d<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>octissimique senis ministerium efficax fore per domini spiritum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ad regni ipsius amplificationem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed hoc ipsum tu nimirum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>rectius pleniusque pridem cognovisti.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salu<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tat te <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName>Marcus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>symmista reverenter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino et symmistae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendissimo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
